# FTS5 virtual tables and triggers: the SQLite dialect cannot parse them.
# Convention: keep them in dedicated migration files whose description ends in
# `_fts5` or `_triggers` (see docs/dev-setup.md). These are the only patterns;
# scripts/sqlfluff.sh reads them from here.
crates/harvey-db/migrations/*_fts5.sql
crates/harvey-db/migrations/*_triggers.sql
